@startuml
' ---- house style (slide) ----
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam wrapWidth 180
<style>
root {
  FontName Helvetica
  FontSize 14
  FontColor #1F2937
}
element { BackgroundColor #F1F5F9; LineColor #475569; LineThickness 1.2; RoundCorner 6 }
arrow   { LineColor #475569; LineThickness 1.2; FontSize 12; MaximumWidth 180 }
note    { BackgroundColor #FFF7E0; LineColor #B45309; FontSize 12; MaximumWidth 220 }
title   { FontSize 18; FontStyle bold }
caption { FontSize 12; FontColor #64748B }
legend  { FontSize 12; BackgroundColor white; LineColor #CBD5E1; MaximumWidth 320 }
.accent { BackgroundColor #1D4ED8; FontColor white; LineColor #1E3A8A }
.alert  { BackgroundColor #FEE2E2; FontColor #7F1D1D; LineColor #B91C1C }
.muted  { BackgroundColor #F8FAFC; FontColor #64748B; LineColor #CBD5E1 }
stateDiagram {
  state { BackgroundColor #F8FAFC }
}
</style>
hide stereotype
' ---- layout (Graphviz dot) ----
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60
left to right direction

' ---- body ----
title state example
hide empty description
' States without a description would otherwise draw an empty second compartment.
' Lifecycles: build rows. A -> B keeps B on the same rank (same row in top-to-bottom), A --> B starts the
' next row. Two opposite edges between the same pair must not both be ->: make one of them -up-> or --> .

[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Submitted : submit
Submitted --> Approved : approve
Submitted --> Rejected : reject
Rejected --> Draft : revise
Approved --> Published : publish
Published --> Archived : archive
Archived --> [*]

Submitted : reviewer assigned
Published : visible to customers
@enduml
